{"success":true,"data":{"name":"Prayas JEE 2026","description":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n  <head>\n     <style>\n       .desc-container {\n         display: flex;\n         flex-direction: column;\n         padding: 16px 13px;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row {\n         display: flex;\n         align-items: center;\n         margin-bottom: 16px;\n         border-bottom: 1px solid #efefef;\n         padding: 4px 0;\n       }\n       \n       .desc-row-item-title {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 22px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n\n       .desc-row-item-content {\n         font-size: 14px;\n         line-height: 18px;\n         margin-right: 6px;\n       }\n     </style>\n  </head>\n\n  <body>\n<div class=\"desc-container\">\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">01.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">PDF Notes of each Class will be uploaded on the PW App.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">02.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Daily Practice Problems with their Video Solution in a Quiz format</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">03.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Peer to Peer doubt-solving will be provided.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">04.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Scheduled tests will be held according to the planner.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">05.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Revision Classes will be provided after syllabus Completion.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">06.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">The complete course will be accessible to all the students until the JEE 2026 Exams.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">07.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Chapterwise Handwritten Notes will be provided</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">08.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">Get Free Access of AITS&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row\">\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-title\">09.</div>\n<div class=\"desc-row-item-content\">The registration fee is included in the price of the batch which is showing on the website. The breakup of registration fee will be mentioned on invoice. You may be provided with access to Notes, PYQ&rsquo;s. Mock Test Papers, AITS Test Series, Previous year batches &amp; other materials, the access can vary depending on the batch you purchase, so that exact details might change from one batch to another.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","shortDescription":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n <head>\n   <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n   <style>\n     .description-meta-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 14px !important;\n     }\n\n     .child-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       align-items: center !important;\n       gap: 12px !important;\n     }\n\n     .icon {\n       width: 32px !important;\n       height: 32px !important;\n     }\n\n     .sub-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .main-text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 600 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text {\n       font-size: 14px !important;\n       font-weight: 500 !important;\n     }\n\n     .text-container {\n       display: flex !important;\n       flex-direction: column !important;\n       gap: 4px !important;\n     }\n   </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n<div class=\"description-meta-container\">\n<div class=\"child-container\"><strong><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/f463046e-0ed5-43b3-981c-944985082135.png\" /></strong>\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\">Course Duration: </span> <span class=\"main-text\">21 April 2025 - 26 Dec 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/972706bc-b79b-41e5-99b4-230290bd296c.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\"><span class=\"sub-text\">Validity:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 600;\">30 June 2026</span><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/9cbf5ddd-2a54-4f92-823c-e908856223c9.png\" /> <span class=\"text\">Online lectures.</span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/9cbf5ddd-2a54-4f92-823c-e908856223c9.png\" /> <span class=\"text\">DPPs and Test With Solutions.&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/9cbf5ddd-2a54-4f92-823c-e908856223c9.png\" /> <span class=\"text\">Exam guidance at our PW Offline centers.</span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/9cbf5ddd-2a54-4f92-823c-e908856223c9.png\" /> <span class=\"text\">One-to-one emotional well-being support by PW Prerna counselors.</span></div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/288f8906-de7a-44c8-8dd9-e9b4dfa15ea7.png\" />In-person support and helpdesk at PW Offline centers.</div>\n<div class=\"child-container\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/a5affa35-0c73-4ca1-8600-65d7ca8a328b.png\" />\n<div class=\"text-container\"><span class=\"sub-text\"> Subjects: Physics, Chemistry &amp; Maths.</span> <span class=\"main-text\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","subjects":[{"_id":"67738e4b073fb66bd4a86d97","subject":"Notices","slug":"notices-282661","icon":"https://d2bps9p1kiy4ka.cloudfront.net/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/95a17012-9abb-4254-82d9-2b18ce08d9dc.png","lectureCount":38,"subjectId":"67738e4b073fb66bd4a86d97"},{"_id":"6774c79727cd349473611a3b","subject":"Physics","slug":"physics-569037","icon":"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/bc2c62dd-a5c5-4da6-93ec-4793a6932071.png","lectureCount":292,"subjectId":"6774c79727cd349473611a3b"},{"_id":"6774c7c69e2e5b7cf9a3253e","subject":"Physical Chemistry","slug":"physical-chemistry-707280","icon":"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/88b9f017-e6d0-402f-a277-a58bed5f99bd.png","lectureCount":97,"subjectId":"6774c7c69e2e5b7cf9a3253e"},{"_id":"6774c8102711a7a752c359f5","subject":"Inorganic Chemistry","slug":"inorganic-chemistry-263546","icon":"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/753e2060-0c6f-4d1c-aef2-6db6b0356db2.png","lectureCount":146,"subjectId":"6774c8102711a7a752c359f5"},{"_id":"6774c825ef5c72fcbdc86669","subject":"Organic Chemistry","slug":"organic-chemistry-561378","icon":"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/fd516bc7-0196-45ee-a8dd-cf95935a2bfa.png","lectureCount":137,"subjectId":"6774c825ef5c72fcbdc86669"},{"_id":"6774c87a49ae53159963f981","subject":"Maths","slug":"maths-024799","icon":"https://static.pw.live/5eb393ee95fab7468a79d189/4ce5a759-dd94-42d4-a7a9-e41f717833ab.png","lectureCount":275,"subjectId":"6774c87a49ae53159963f981"}]}}